                  "system": "urn:form-examples:nerve-conduction-study-test-result",
                  "code": "nerve_conduction_findings",
                  "display": "Nerve Conduction Findings"
                }
              ]
            },
            "valueString": "Severely reduced or absent sensory and motor amplitudes in the peroneal, tibial, and sural nerves bilaterally, with relatively preserved conduction velocities, in keeping with a severe, length-dependent, predominantly axonal sensorimotor polyneuropathy."
          },
